{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04889","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 李乂","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涌塔临玄地，高层瞰紫微。\n鸣銮陪帝出，攀橑翊天飞。\n庆洽重阳寿，文含列象辉。\n小臣叨载笔，欣此颂巍巍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}